    "limitations": [
      "Table lists in-state laboratories that appear on both (a) DCLS VELAP Chapter 46 commercial directory (list dated 7/1/2026) as CERTIFIED and (b) DCLS DW_Certified_Labs Excel current as of 8/1/2026.",
      "Division of Consolidated Laboratory Services (DCLS Lab ID 460319) is on both lists but is omitted from the homeowner table because DCLS\u2019s Environmental FAQ states it does not provide private-well testing for homeowners.",
      "Out-of-state Chapter 46 commercial labs omitted \u2014 use the official Find a Lab Excel/PDF.",
      "Other in-state labs appear only on the full DW Certified Labs Excel (including many water-plant / utility laboratories and some labs not on the Chapter 46 commercial directory). They are not tabulated here; use the official Excel/PDF.",
      "Neither the commercial directory nor the DW Excel labels private-well acceptance. Every commercial row is unknown \u2014 call first. Mail vs drop-off unknown. Prices intentionally omitted.",
      "Verified private-well path is the Virginia Household Water Quality Program (VAHWQP) drinking-water clinics via local Cooperative Extension \u2014 not a year-round individual drop-off at Virginia Tech. VDH states it does not test private wells. DCLS does not test private wells for homeowners.",
      "Phone numbers and addresses taken from the DW Excel when present; Schneider phone filled from the Chapter 46 commercial directory when Excel phone was blank; Joiner phone filled from the Chapter 46 directory when Excel phone was blank.",
      "Cert expiration dates shown are the CERT EXPIRATION DATE column from the DW Excel (often 2027-06-30)."
    ]
  },
